      "created_at": "2016-11-22T18:30:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the past I've found Spiff's comprehensive FAQ highly useful, as information is organized in a logical way (by character). He stopped updating it once the Fireside chats started, however, they are really hard to find particular information during a game. Is there any plan to incorporate the Fireside Chats into that FAQ or in a similar format?</p><p>If the answer is no, would the community be interested in a joint effort of compiling the answers separated by deck(s). Maybe as a webapp or as part of the wiki.</p>",
