    {
      "id": 185451,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-27T01:41:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is the same Fireside Chat topic updated whenever there's something new added, or is there a new one added each time there's a new set of info? &nbsp;If the same topic keeps getting updated, then it would be difficult to make sure a FAQ is up to date with the latest Fireside Chat info since you'd always have to browse back over the same topic to see if your FAQ contains everything in the Chat. &nbsp;But if a new Fireside Chat post is added each time there's new info, then keeping a FAQ updated would be easier.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:10:58.131Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
